{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"agent_message","text":"The focused regression tests and `go vet` passed. I found a scope issue in R2: seal readiness checks for structural facts but never checks whether a required criterion asks for mappings. The conclusion validator does check that condition, so the new seal gate can reject scopes the existing gate would accept. I’m also checking R3’s promised run-ID input.\n"}}
